  unitName: Tireless Stalker Magena (EU)
  unitId: 750147
  unitNumber: 7227
  description: The politician has always sought vengeance against the one who murdered
    her parents and her dear sister. Unfortunately, due to a revolutionary extremist,
    she could not reach her goals. If Magena had not taken an interest in politics,
    she would have focused all of her energy on finding the killer. She would have
    led a group of individuals whose lives had also been ruined by Cornelius. With
    her companions, she would have discreetly tracked down the seafaring Shapeshifter,
    seeking information in order to assemble an infallible plan. However, would she
    find peace after exacting her vengeance?
  summonDesc: 
  fusionDesc: Politics? No,  it won't help me in my hunt...
  evoDesc: Migina... You will be avenged, i swear !
